                        <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#scholarshipfaq-one" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="scholarshipfaq-one">
                            1. Can Indian students apply for scholarships in any country?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="scholarshipfaq-one" class="accordion-collapse collapse show">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            Yes, Indian students can apply for scholarships offered by many countries, universities, and organizations worldwide. Each scholarship may have its own criteria related to nationality, course, or academic performance, so check individual scholarship details to confirm eligibility before applying.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#scholarshipfaq-two" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="scholarshipfaq-two">
                            2. Do I need work experience for international scholarships?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="scholarshipfaq-two" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            Most undergraduate scholarships do not require work experience, but some postgraduate scholarships, especially for MBA or research programs, may ask for it. Check the eligibility guidelines of each scholarship to see if relevant work experience is needed as part of your application.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#scholarshipfaq-three" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="scholarshipfaq-three">
                            3. How competitive are study abroad scholarships for Indian students?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="scholarshipfaq-three" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            Scholarships are quite competitive as many students from around the world apply. A strong academic record, good test scores, leadership skills, and a well-written personal statement can help you stand out and improve your chances of receiving a scholarship award.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#scholarshipfaq-four" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="scholarshipfaq-four">
                            4. Can I get a full scholarship that covers all expenses?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="scholarshipfaq-four" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            Some scholarships cover full tuition and living expenses, while others may only provide partial funding. Full scholarships are highly competitive. Research thoroughly to find such opportunities, and focus on submitting a strong, complete application that matches all the stated requirements.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#scholarshipfaq-five" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="scholarshipfaq-five">
                            5. Is there an age limit to apply for scholarships abroad?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="scholarshipfaq-five" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            Certain scholarships may have age restrictions, especially those offered by governments or specific programs. Many university-funded options focus on academic merit and do not have strict age limits. Always verify age criteria in the scholarship guidelines before beginning your application.
                        </div>
